    "answer": {
      "short": "4 females",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total parts} &= 13+11=24\\\\24\\text{ parts} &= 48\\text{ people}\\\\1\\text{ part} &= 48\\div24=2\\text{ people}\\\\\\text{Females} &= 13\\times2=26\\\\\\text{Males} &= 11\\times2=22\\\\\\text{Females leaving} &= 26-22=4\\end{align*}$$\n4 females must leave, leaving 22 females and 22 males, a ratio of $1:1$.",
